NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1912.

30810      proc glm data=ozoneSet plots=none;
30811      model ozone = East East*East North North*North;
30812      output out=gmout predicted=pred residual=ResidualOzone;
30813      run;


NOTE: The data set WORK.GMOUT has 300 observations and 5 variables.
